                    We are looking for an **AI Creative Architect / AI Creative Strategist** to join our company in a permanent, long-term role.



We need someone who is **extremely up to date with the AI ecosystem**, understands the leading tools, models, LLMs, and platforms available today, and constantly follows new releases and emerging technologies.



We are not looking for someone who simply knows how to use ChatGPT or generate a few AI images or videos.



We are looking for someone who can build **AI-powered creative systems**, design dynamic workflows, and automate large-scale advertising content production.



## Responsibilities



The selected candidate should be able to:



* Continuously research, test, and implement new AI tools;

* Work with leading LLMs and generative AI models;

* Build advanced workflows for creative production;

* Automate bulk video creation;

* Automate static ad production and creative variations;

* Build systems capable of generating dozens or hundreds of creatives from a limited number of inputs;

* Automate hooks, scripts, voiceovers, images, videos, captions, editing, and creative variations;

* Connect multiple AI tools within the same workflow;

* Build scalable creative pipelines;

* Develop systems that allow the marketing team to produce significantly more content in less time;

* Analyze existing creative processes and identify opportunities to improve speed, quality, and output through AI;

* Document workflows and make them usable by the rest of the team.



## Tools & Technologies



We are looking for someone with strong experience or familiarity with tools and technologies such as:



* ChatGPT / OpenAI;

* Claude;

* Gemini;

* Seedance;

* Veo;

* Sora;

* Kling;

* Runway;

* ElevenLabs;

* Midjourney;

* Flux;

* Ideogram;

* Nano Banana and similar models;

* ComfyUI;

* n8n;

* Make;

* APIs;

* Webhooks;

* Custom automation systems;

* Video generation tools;

* Image generation tools;

* Voice generation tools;

* Newly released and emerging AI models.



You do not need to work exclusively with these tools.



What matters most is having an **early-adopter mindset**, staying constantly updated, and quickly understanding which new technologies can meaningfully improve our creative production processes.



## AI Creative Strategy



This is not only a technical role.



We are looking for someone who also understands **creative strategy and performance advertising**.



You should understand concepts such as:



* Creative ads;

* Hooks;

* Marketing angles;

* Customer awareness;

* Customer avatars;

* Pain points;

* Desires;

* VSLs;

* UGC;

* Direct response;

* Static ads;

* Video ads;

* Creative iterations;

* Creative testing;

* Bulk creative production.



The goal is to combine **AI + automation + creative strategy**.



We do not simply want to produce more content.



We want to build systems that allow us to produce **more creatives, faster, while continuously increasing quality**.



## Ideal Profile



We are looking for someone who is:



* Obsessed with new AI technologies;

* Constantly following new model releases;

* Extremely fast at testing new tools;

* Able to connect different technologies together;

* Both creative and technical;

* Able to think in systems;

* Strong at problem-solving;

* Independent;

* Curious;

* Proactive;

* Highly output-driven.



We strongly prefer candidates who use AI every day and actively follow new models, tools, frameworks, research, and automation opportunities.



## Permanent In-House Role



This is not a one-off freelance collaboration.



We are looking for someone to join the company in a **stable, permanent role** and become our internal reference point for AI, automation, and creative production.



You will be responsible for continuously building, improving, and evolving our AI-powered creative infrastructure.



## How to Apply



We mainly want to see what you can actually build.



Please send us:



* Your best AI workflows;

* Creative automation systems you have built;

* Bulk video generation workflows;

* Static ad generation systems;

* Projects involving multiple AI models connected together;

* Demos, Loom videos, screenshots, or recordings of your workflows;

* The AI tools and models you currently use;

* Which new AI models or tools you are currently testing;

* Any experience with DTC brands, e-commerce, or performance marketing;

* Your availability;

* Your expected monthly salary.



**Do not apply by only describing your skills.**



We want to see real systems, real workflows, and real projects you have built.



Your ability to stay constantly updated with the AI ecosystem will be one of the most important criteria in our selection process.



We are looking for someone who can become our internal **AI Creative Architect** and help us build a competitive advantage through AI, automation, and creative strategy.
